Z||000002||Carrolles||10-04-1999||05:54 PM||||I converted an 89 Bonneville three years ago and have had no trouble.  It seems to cool just as good as it did with R-12.<BR>I'm replacing the A/C compressor during my current clutch/rebuilt engine swap and will convert to R-134 in the process.  I will replace all of the o-rings while I'm at it.  A couple up front require taking out the spare tire tub liner to gain access to the connections.<P>Take care,<BR>Carroll||||reg||1
